WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.980
Bro...

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:07.400
What are we gonna do about getting our 10 million yen?

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:11.360
What, you say? We're going to do "that" of course.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.820
Huh? What do you mean by "that?"

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:15.820
Let's go.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:19.290
Alright, Bro!

00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:00.970
Breaking a law of the Witch World will not result in just a cold.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:06.240
You may not use magic at all from today until the middle of the month, alright?

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.680
Today's the last day.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.640
I guess I still can't do it until nightfall...

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:37.280
I wish the sun would go down faster.

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:45.860
Hadzuki-chan is Kidnapped!

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:53.030
Bro, the family in that house there is probably loaded.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:56.980
You think? If we kidnap a kid from that house, then 10 million yen will just fall into our laps.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.990
But, are we really going to go through with it?

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:01.640
You moron, do you really think we have another way?

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:02.660
I'm going now.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.310
Here she comes, Bro!

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:06.160
Alright!

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:13.710
Ah, excuse me, little girl!

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:14.740
Yes?

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:20.220
Hey, do you know any doctors around here? My buddy here's in a lotta pain.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.390
Eh? Who's in pain?

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:23.920
You! You!

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:27.460
Who else but you? Don't play dumb! Hurry up and act as if you're in pain!

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:29.210
Uhm, excuse me.

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:29.750
Yes?

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.310
If you're looking for a doctor's office, there's one over there.

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:37.620
Ahh, so there is...

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:39.570
Well then, excuse me.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:45.030
When are you gonna cut that out!?

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:47.010
Aah, w-wait a second!

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:47.540
Yes?

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.000
Is there anything else?

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.780
I-I got a toothache! A toothache!

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:53.460
Ahhh ow ow ow ow ow ow!

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.790
There are no dentists nearby...

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:56.720
...ow ow ow ow!

00:03:56.720 --> 00:04:00.240
Hey, hey hey, I'm sorry, little girl, but could you take us to a dentist?

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:01.760
Ouch! The agony!

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:04.890
Well, it's on the way to the Maho-dou anyway.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:05.720
That's fine.

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:09.070
Good! Then, get in! Get in!

00:04:09.070 --> 00:04:09.430
Okay.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:21.820
Uhm, turn left at the next light and you'll find a dentist.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:31.140
Do you still not realize it? We're kidnapping you, little girl.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:33.710
This is a hold up.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:35.920
A... A gun?

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:43.840
Good morning!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.340
Ah, you're in a good mood today.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:49.760
That's 'cuz today's the day Hadzuki-chan gets her magic back.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:53.730
I'm happy just thinkin' the three of us can do magic again.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:59.650
If I remember correctly, the ban will be lifted tonight. But the sun is still up.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.550
I already know that little detail!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.140
So... where is she?

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:10.080
She's not here yet. She's very rarely late though.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.340
Doremi's not here either.

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:15.040
Hmph! Doremi's always late.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:18.250
Right, right. No need to worry 'bout her!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.380
Is someone spreading rumors about me?

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:26.200
Who's gonna talk bad about Doremi anyway?

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.080
I don't need you scolding me!

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:30.890
Doremi, you seem to be taking things slowly.

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:35.120
Oh no! I'm gonna be late!

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:38.190
W-Water!

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:39.480
Here.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:45.110
God you're clumsy.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:47.230
Hey, tie her up so she won't run away!

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:48.070
Got it Bro!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:49.980
Well, what should I use to tie her?

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:52.740
Huh? How about using vinyl tape?

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:53.720
Oh yeah.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.040
Er, excuse me?

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:59.790
Even if you don't tie me up, I still can't move about.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:03.210
Hey, keep an eye on her! I'm gonna ask for the money!

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.090
Alright.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:07.050
If only I could use magic now...

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:10.340
...I could clean this place up.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:15.650
"We've got your daughter."

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:17.010
Ah, Bro!

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.730
I can't find our hostage!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:22.320
Why are you looking through the binoculars!?

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:24.980
But you said to keep an eye on her, Bro.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:29.100
We're not soldiers, so we don't need that kind of equipment!

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.340
She's really gone!

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:36.830
Hey! Just what are you writing!?

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:38.660
I'm sorry.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:41.360
You made so many mistakes, so I corrected them for you.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:46.780
Wow Bro, this is awful!

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:47.470
You shut it!

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:49.280
But her handwriting is really pretty.

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.890
Little girl, you're pretty smart.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:57.850
It's already this late. Doremi-chan and the others must be worried.

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:01.400
Ahhhhh! Fire! Put out the fire, Bro!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:04.980
You idiot! The phone, the phone! Find it!

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.840
Ahhh! Uhhh!

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:10.210
Phone phone phone phone phone phone phone phone phone phone!

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:11.060
Found it!

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:12.410
Here, Bro!

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:15.090
Hello?

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:17.540
Huh, your pizza still hasn't arrived?

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:18.440
How should I know!?

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:20.330
Uhm...

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:24.930
If you have a phone, I think it'd be better to call instead of writing a letter.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:29.290
Here's the phone number.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:32.840
This way you can talk to a person directly and not make so many mistakes.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:34.800
Thanks.

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:38.350
I'm late! I'm late!

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:42.770
Hello...

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:45.110
I've got your daughter.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.190
Huuuuh?

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:49.190
You mean me and Pop?

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:49.900
What?

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.640
But we're both here.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:56.280
Jeez, I'm busy, so please stop making prank calls!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:08:01.020
I ain't kidding! It's Hadzuki! Fujiwara Hadzuki! She's your daughter, right?

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:07.210
If you want her back, bring 10 million yen! The place is Misora Street 2-10-5.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:12.200
What's goin' on? Hadzuki-chan still ain't here.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.640
Yes, it is getting pretty late.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:17.200
She usually has a good reason for being late...

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.270
Doremi-chan...

00:08:22.510 --> 00:08:26.710
Ha-Hadzuki-chan was... Hadzuki-chan was kidnapped!

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.650
Ehh!? Kidnapped!?

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:33.720
They called me on the phone and said that I had to bring 10 million yen to Misora Street 2-10-5!

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:34.610
What do we do Ai-chan!?

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.280
They called Doremi-chan?

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.580
We have to do something.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.160
Let's go, Doremi-chan!

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:43.520
They said they got Hadzuki-chan at Misora Street 2-10-5, right?

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:47.500
The fact that they called <i>you</i>  means they got the number from Hadzuki-chan.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:49.760
You're right!

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:50.290
Yeah!

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.020
Come on!

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:52.690
Okay!

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:56.320
Hey, what are you doing!? What about the store!? The store!

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:58.550
We have no choice! This is an emergency.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:08:59.140
Oh goodness...

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:02.520
Right when Hadzuki-chan can't use her magic too...

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:03.970
What should we do?

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:07.480
Leave them be. I can't go out anyway.

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:12.190
Misora Street 2-10-5...

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.690
It's here!

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:17.430
Alright! We're gonna save Hadzuki-chan with 10 million yen!

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.660
Eh? But how do we get 10 million yen?

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.370
Are ya stupid? We get the money with magic!

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:24.870
Ahh, of course.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:43.540
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.910
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:51.960
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:55.240
Ten million yen, appear!

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:59.040
What the heck is this?

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.450
Alright, leave it to me!

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:06.770
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.840
Ten million yen...

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:09.670
Appear!

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:12.680
What the?

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:13.450
Oh no!

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:17.590
We've never seen 10 million yen, so we can't use magic to make it!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.550
What should we do?

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:23.260
I thought I heard Doremi-chan and Aiko-chan's voice.

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:25.140
Hey, stop!

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:25.680
Doremi-chan...

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:27.640
You brat, what are you trying to do!?

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:30.410
Hadz...!

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.980
Hadzuki-chan is... Hadzuki-chan is...

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:38.650
Keep it together, Doremi-chan! Listen, let's become policemen using magic!

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:41.120
P-Policemen, right? Got it!

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.540
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:50.830
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.600
Become a policeman!

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.080
Bro! A siren!

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:08.100
Ugh! It's a patrol car! Let's beat it!

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.230
Doremi-chan!

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:14.980
Hadzuki-chan!

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:18.740
Jeez! Watch it!

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:21.900
Hadzuki-chan!

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:23.200
That car!

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.870
We gotta follow 'em, Doremi-chan!

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:25.990
Leave it to me!

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:51.040
Damnit...

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:54.770
They found us this fast! Japan's cops are something else!

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.730
Who was it that said where we were on the phone?

00:11:58.610 --> 00:11:59.690
What? That was me!?

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:02.140
Ah, no way!

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:04.160
How else would they find out?

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.620
Ai-chan, Doremi-chan.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:08.580
Hadzuki-chan!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.100
Oh no, we're losin' 'em!

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:12.790
Alright, then how about this?

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:17.200
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.500
Stop time!

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:22.040
We did it!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:25.840
Hadzuki-chan, the lock! The lock!

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:29.760
But we stopped time! She can't hear us!

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:30.350
Oh yeah...

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:41.030
Follow after 'em, Doremi-chan!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.900
Ahh, wait, Ai-chan!

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.740
Alright, it's my turn!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:52.790
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:59.140
Bro, all this weird stuff must be the work of a demon fox.

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:01.420
M-M-Moron! Those things are just a fairy tale! Utter nonsense!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:04.380
Oh no, I can't focus at all!

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:06.340
Well, I'll try now!

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:10.610
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:21.700
Bro, this feels pretty real... you sure it's not our imagination?

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.180
It's just your imagination!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:28.570
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:36.160
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:38.900
Please stop!

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:44.980
Bro, do you still not believe me?

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:47.340
T-This is all a trick! How can I believe you!?

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.950
Alright, this time for sure!

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.060
I'm out of magic spheres!

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:56.480
Instead of "stop," you were thinkin' "tomato," weren'tcha?
(Tomaru = Stop)

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:58.240
Hey I was close!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.070
Here, eat up!

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:07.020
Thank you very much.

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.490
It's delicious!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:15.610
Right? Bro can make instant ramen really delicious!

00:14:15.610 --> 00:14:17.110
You stupid idiot!

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:20.960
It's probably crap to a lady like her who eats great food every day.

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:23.670
No, it's really delicious!

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:25.330
Y-You think?

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:28.580
Uhm...

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:31.550
Why did you kidnap me?

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:32.840
That's...

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:34.560
To become stars.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:38.480
Stars? Like singers or actors?

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:39.800
Yeah.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:45.440
You saying you want to become stars makes me want to laugh.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.940
I knew you'd laugh.

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:49.240
You knew?

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:54.240
Actually, we are known as the Papaya Brothers, a comedy troop.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:57.700
I've never heard of that name.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:00.040
We're not popular, so sue me!

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.760
How many years has it been?

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:10.220
We came all the way from the country-side.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:12.730
But we...

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.680
We never became popular at all.

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:19.540
The talent office told us to go home.

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:22.970
And then...

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:27.480
We got a chance to become stars, if we could come up with 10 million yen.

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:30.450
So that's why you kidnapped me, right?

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:31.130
Yeah.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:35.410
We still have a dream to strike it big!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:41.040
But... Do you think you still can achieve your dream by kidnapping me?

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:46.590
You said you were doing comedy, right?

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:50.770
Then if you still can't make people laugh, all of this will be in vain.

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:55.220
L-L-L-Little girl, we've had to make compromises.

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.650
Could you show me your usual routine?

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:02.660
A-Alright, let's do it!

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:03.900
Let's do it, Bro!

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:08.030
Papa!

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:10.070
Yaaaan!

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:14.140
B-Bro, she laughed!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:15.410
We did it!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:19.870
No way! That routine ain't gonna work against this Naniwa girl!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:21.570
W-Who are you?

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:24.000
Bro, we gotta eliminate anyone who's seen us!

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.000
M-Moron!

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:34.130
I told you not to use that!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:37.600
Hey, that's not funny threatening us with a toy gun!

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:42.060
Ya think ya can get away after kidnappin' such a lovely girl?

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.070
Wait a second!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:48.530
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:52.440
Punish the kidnappers!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:54.950
Bro!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:04.020
Ahh! Why are we up here?

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:05.750
Yaahh! I'm scared!

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:08.960
Ai-chan, stop it! They're not bad people!

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:12.310
But kidnappin' ya means they're bad, Hadzuki-chan.

00:17:12.310 --> 00:17:14.810
I can't let them get away with it that easily!

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:19.180
Right, Hadzuki-chan, you're still being punished by the Queen too!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:22.020
But... Even so...

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:25.520
We... We... Won't kidnap anyone ever again!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.810
So please let us down!

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.480
We're sorry!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:33.940
Please, they've seen the error of their ways, so you have to forgive them!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:36.950
Alright then. Since ya asked nicely, I'll forgive 'em.

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:40.670
Y'all really ain't gonna kidnap anyone again, right!?

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:41.240
Yes!!

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.560
Okay, Doremi-chan. Get 'em back down with yer magic.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:45.640
Heh? Me?

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:48.500
Come on now, that last spell used up all my spheres.

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:51.670
N-No way! I ran out of magic spheres a long time ago!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:52.750
Ya kiddin'?

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.690
Hadzuki-chan, you still can't use magic?

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:56.220
Not yet.

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:59.180
The sun hasn't set yet.

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.630
So, no one can help them?

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:14.070
The branch is about to break!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:15.380
I-It is!

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:16.570
What do we do, Ai-chan?

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:18.740
It's all my fault!

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:26.940
A-Ai-chan!

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.880
I'll help ya! Gimme yer hand!

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:42.640
Hadzuki-chan, I'm going too!

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:46.220
Ai-chan!

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:49.720
I can't hold on! They're too heavy for me!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.000
H-Help us!

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.940
I don't wanna look down!

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:19.010
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:30.270
Please, Queen of the Witch World!

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:32.900
I know it's not time yet.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:35.980
I know the sun hasn't set yet.

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:37.610
Please!

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:42.360
Please let me use my magic now!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:55.250
Thank you, your Majesty!

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:05.610
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:09.310
Please save the Papaya Brothers!

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:20.110
Are we dead?

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.690
Bro!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:26.420
By the way, those kids were flying around on brooms weren't they?

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:28.590
Maybe they're aliens?

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:30.620
Maybe it was them.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:33.870
Foxes?

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:36.540
We...

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:38.640
were fooled by foxes?

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:45.580
Looks like they're easily tricked.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:49.370
What were you thinking!? You were flying and using magic in front of people!

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:51.940
You really are Ojamajos!

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:54.560
Hey! We had no choice! It was an emergency!

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:59.400
But the sun ain't set yet, so how come Hadzuki-chan can use her magic?

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:04.700
I'm sure the Queen heard Hadzuki-chan's wish.

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:08.100
The Queen sure is watching over us.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.830
We're really sorry.

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:17.290
Good luck on your comedy acts, okay?

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:20.120
Well then, take care. Goodbye!

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:21.460
G-Goodbye!

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:26.780
She laughed at our joke.

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:29.760
Yeah... That joke... That was the first time someone's laughed at it.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:32.310
I'm brimming with confidence now!

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:35.620
Me too! Alright, from now on, we'll do our best!

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:36.140
Alright!

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:40.770
They're still so stiff like usual.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.980
I think the SOS Trio's got some new rivals...

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:45.200
How funny.

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:49.160
That's not right!

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:50.820
But we don't know any other way!

00:21:50.820 --> 00:21:51.990
Don't say you don't know!

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:52.900
We are...

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:54.460
Papa!

00:21:54.460 --> 00:21:55.250
Yaaaaan!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.760
Today truly is a sad day.

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:10.840
Our beloved Maho-dou is about to be taken over.

00:22:10.840 --> 00:22:11.990
Wait a second!

00:22:11.990 --> 00:22:13.200
What's the meanin' of this?

00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:16.920
If Majo Rika loses, she'll lose everything!

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:17.690
Heeeeeeeh!?

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:21.520
What an idiot! What about her plan to return to normal!?

00:22:21.520 --> 00:22:22.730
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:25.570
The Rival Debuts! The Maho-dou is in Big Trouble!!

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:28.530
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
